#### Maulana Rumi: A brief biography

Maulānā Jalāl ad-Dīn Muhammad Rūmī (Persian: جلال‌ادین محمدرومي‎, romanized: Jalāl al-din Muḥammad Rumî; also transliterated as Mawlana Rumi or Molavi) was a 13th century Persian poet and Sufi mystic. He is widely considered to be one of the greatest poets in Islamic history, though he has also been hugely influential outside his own religion;
